description:
The Dragon Boat Festival Family Fun Day is back in 2026 for another day of culture, community and celebration! &nbsp;
Join us for a free, all-ages celebration of the Dragon Boat Festival, in partnership with the Waitakere Chinese Association.
There’ll be live performances, activities, hands-on arts and crafts, including a special kite-making workshop led by CEAC’s art educators! As well as delicious food and Chinese seasonal specialities.
If you would like to get involved contact:&nbsp;

